00:01:21.281 --> 00:01:28.389
Sora ni junengo no boku ni
mukete yakusoku shita

00:01:28.389 --> 00:01:33.994
Zutto shinjiteiru asu wa
machigai ja nai

00:01:33.994 --> 00:01:40.334
Kitto dare yori mo
tsuyoi omoi motteiru kara

00:01:40.334 --> 00:01:44.600
Sotto

